# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-cityw04-0 = 
    你立于城墙旁，近一古旧的出城门。高处，一名士兵踽踽巡行。你决定……<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>让$ChosenOneName攀上高处，为你放下绳索。<br><p><opt>...<indent>抛弃马匹，让$ChosenOneName上去为你放下绳索。<br><p><opt>...<indent>试图徒手攀爬而上。<br><p><opt>...<indent>抛弃马匹，尝试徒手攀爬。<br><p><opt>...<indent>撬开下水道井盖，潜入其中。<br><p><opt>...<indent>抛弃马匹，撬开下水道井盖，潜入其中。<br><p><opt-items>...<indent>对突袭门施以炼金术。<br><p><opt-saints>...<indent>祈求圣者庇佑。<br><p><opt>...<indent>向守卫行贿$Money1，以求入内。<br><p><opt>...<indent>悄悄沿来路退回。
msg-cityw04-1 = 
    用绳索，$ChosenOneName攀上墙头，随后将绳索放下给其余众人。不久，你们皆已深入$PlaceName。
msg-cityw04-2 = 
    Valiantly trying to reach the top of the wall, $ChosenOneName suddenly slips and falls. Landing with an audible "oof!", $he sits up and glares at the wall. Perhaps it is a tougher climb than it first appeared.{" "}
msg-cityw04-3 = 
    缺绳索，众人各自攀墙。功成身退，旋即入$PlaceName境内。
msg-cityw04-4 = 
    Lacking a rope, you each try to climb the wall individually, but $ChosenOneName clumsily slips and falls to the ground, hurting $himself on the rocks below. The rest of you climb back down to see if $he needs any help.{" "}
msg-cityw04-5 = 
    尽全力施展你自己，以你的力，$ChosenOneName将你的臂抵于下水道铁栅之上。费力缓慢地，铁栅终于从嵌槽中松动，众人攀入黑暗污秽的下水道。穿行于漆黑如墨的隧洞多时，终觅得出口，爬升至地面。下水道的淤泥与恶臭久久不散，使你在$PlaceName之中的声望有所下降。
msg-cityw04-6 = 
    Exerting $himself to the limits of $his strength, $ChosenOneName applies $himself to the edges of the sewer grating. But try as $he might, $he cannot pry it open. It's just too well-made.{" "}
msg-cityw04-7 = 
    The potion smashes open against the sturdy sally port, but the door holds. The sound, however, attracts a patrol's attention, and soon soldiers holding torches can be seen running toward you. Annoyed, you retreat from the city and make further plans.{" "}
msg-cityw04-8 = 
    以最令人满意的姿态炸裂，雷霆一击粉碎了突门，将大门震得脱离铰链。你在守卫赶来查看之前冲了进去，很快便深入城内。
msg-cityw04-9 = 
    酸液被小心翼翼地倾倒在月门上，嘶嘶作响，腐蚀着锁的金属。然而这需要时间，待其完全溶解时，你已看见几名士兵朝这边走来。在他们于夜色中发现你之前，你悄然穿过月门，遁入城中，消失无踪。<br>
msg-cityw04-10 = 
    Flames lick upward, burning the door's wooden structure. Guards are attracted by the sight, but soon it is weakened to the point that you can simply burst through. Rushing through the fire, you escape into the city before the guards can get to you. However, everyone is singed a bit by the heat.{" "}
msg-cityw04-11 = 
    Luckily, $NamedOneName hears your prayer and answers. An unearthly glint of light shines on your forms as you are levitated over the wall into the city.{" "}
msg-cityw04-12 = 
    Unfortunately, $NamedOneName does not answer your prayers.{" "}
msg-cityw04-13 = 
    You call softly through the sally port until the sergeant of the guard answers. You offer him a stiff bribe to be permitted into the city, and greedily he counts the proffered money again and again. At last he is convinced of your good faith, and opens the sally port, ushering you within.{" "}
msg-cityw04-14 = 
    You call softly through the sally port until the sergeant of the guard answers. You offer him a stiff bribe to be permitted into the city, and greedily he begins to count holds shines onto your faces, and when he looks up, he suddenly squints and recognizes you. "Oh, ho! You! Enemies of $PlaceName." he says. "I might be corrupt, but I'm not THAT corrupt!" He calls for reinforcements and guards rush to help you. You are forced to run away, back to the fields at the city's edge from whence you must plan your next move.{" "}
msg-cityw04-15 = 
    大声向圣莱诺德祈祷，忽见墙上闪过一道光芒。你上前查看，却分不清那面墙是横的还是竖的。$ChosenOneName大胆地踏上墙面，发现你竟可如在城中漫步般轻松地垂直而上。众人纷纷效仿，不久便已进入城内。
